.\" It is New Year's Eve, when Tamachan got very upset with the fairies after realizing that the fairies haven't done any of the required chores. This episode has a soap opera, and tazukuri, or rice fields. This episode will continue in January.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"This episode starts with \"Santa Kururu.\" It is New Year's Eve, when Tamachan got very upset with the fairies after realizing that the fairies haven't done any of the required chores. This episode has a soap opera, and tazukuri, or rice fields. This episode will continue in January.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"December","titleLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1092","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"348","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"348","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"12423","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"85595","synopsis":"December continues, but now it is New Year's Day. This is a episode anyone will love. Tamachan introduces Sugoroku to the fairies, a Japanese board game that helps the fairies celebrate the new year. This episode ends with being arrested and a dream of becoming humans.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"December continues, but now it is New Year's Day. This is a episode anyone will love. Tamachan introduces Sugoroku to the fairies, a Japanese board game that helps the fairies celebrate the new year. This episode ends with being arrested and a dream of becoming humans.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"January","titleLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"prov